          "gm": "<p>The Tech-Assassin may inject one dose of a substance at will as an in-turn Free Action by succeeding on a Routine (+10) Fortitude Test. A failed test inflicts the Fatigued condition. It is possible to gland a drug even if stunned, unconscious, or unable to act. The Tech-Assassin specifically carries doses of Slaught, Stimm, Pain Suppressant, and Frenzon.</p>"
